# Graphics Basic (C64): its keywords and tokens, from petcat (VICE 3.7.1): petcat -wgraph.
# Use it in a BASIC file with: tokenfile graphics-basic
# BASIC V2's keywords are here too, so the longest keyword that matches is the one taken.
# Its programs start at $1001, not $0801: build them with that load address.

